    "sections": {
        "description": "Canvex is a minimalistic WordPress theme for developers — a full site editing (FSE) block theme built for full stack developers, designers, freelancers, and photographers who want a clean, professional portfolio without a page builder. Built entirely on the native WordPress Site Editor, Canvex includes Hero and Projects block patterns along with global style controls for colors and typography. It ships with all essential templates — Front Page, Index, All Archives, Single Post, Pages, Search Results, and 404 — for a complete site-building foundation. Lightweight, fast-loading, fully responsive, and SEO-ready with clean semantic HTML5, Canvex is the ideal WordPress theme for developer portfolios, designer portfolios, freelancer websites, and photographer galleries seeking a fast, minimalistic, and highly professional online presence."
    },
